<title>SPAIN: Spain's BCH sold 5.92 pct of Aumar.</title>
<headline>Spain's BCH sold 5.92 pct of Aumar.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Central Hispano (BCH) has sold 5.92 percent of motorway concessionary Autopistas del Mare Nostrum (Aumar), the stock market commission CMNV confirmed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>BCH sold around 3.9 million shares for a total value of 8.4 billion pesetas, and now has a 12.19 percent direct stake in Aumar.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
